{
  "description": "CallbackUrl: form check for the build, then params (query if non-empty, else fragment; duplicate keys or a bad escape -> malformed), then exact shape (success = exactly state+jwe; error = state+error, min/max only with protocol_unsupported, server_time only with handoff_timestamp_skewed; HandoffCallback schema patterns), then pending (null -> no_pending), then constant-time state compare, then age (now - created_at > ttl -> expired). Order of checks is the order listed. mode https expects https://<domain>/auth/callback (host compared case-insensitively, no port/userinfo); mode dev expects yaranapp://auth/callback (scheme case-insensitive).",
